59:10.000 --> 59:13.000
If you were spilling anything, you would say ‘Oh, what a splooter’.

59:13.000 --> 59:16.000
[XX] Would you say splootering? ‘Stop your splootering.’

59:16.000 --> 59:17.000
Aye.

59:18.000 --> 59:19.000
Well, probably …

59:19.000 --> 59:21.000
It’s just connected with [spleiter/?].

59:21.000 --> 59:24.000
Aye … it’s something similar.

59:24.000 --> 59:27.000
What about [caointeachs/?]?

59:27.000 --> 59:30.000
