59:48.000 --> 59:50.000
You know ‘You’re sitting there like a [caointeach/?].’

59:50.000 --> 59:52.000
Oh, I thought it was the way you sat.

59:52.000 --> 59:54.000
The position you were sitting in.

59:54.000 --> 59:55.000
