‘You’re sitting there like a [caointeach/?].’

01:00:04.000 --> 01:00:06.000
You know, to a human.

01:00:06.000 --> 01:00:07.000
You wouldn’t say …

01:00:07.000 --> 01:00:09.000
it wasn’t said to an animal or anything.

01:00:10.000 --> 01:00:11.000
I’ve heard that expression

01:00:11.000 --> 01:00:13.000
‘She’s sitting there like a [caointeach/?].’

01:00:13.000 --> 01:00:16.000
I mean I’ve heard of it … so often.

01:00:16.000 --> 01:00:19.000
It seems to apply to a human, you know.

01:00:21.000 --> 01:00:25.000
