01:00:25.000 --> 01:00:29.000
No, I just thought it was sitting [crouched/?] up.

01:00:30.000 --> 01:00:31.000
Sitting like a [caointeach/?],

01:00:31.000 --> 01:00:33.000
whatever a [caointeach/?] was. 

01:00:33.000 --> 01:00:34.000
But it applied really to a human,

01:00:34.000 --> 01:00:38.000
it didn’t apply to an animal or anything like that, you know.

01:00:39.000 --> 01:00:40.000
[...]

01:00:42.000 --> 01:00:44.000
Years ago,

01:00:44.000 --> 01:00:47.000
aye and if your dad was here he would mind it too,

