01:01:04.000 --> 01:01:05.000
A light.

01:01:05.000 --> 01:01:07.000
Was it no’ a flower or …

01:01:07.000 --> 01:01:08.000
No, it’s a light.

01:01:08.000 --> 01:01:12.000
It’s a light but I canna explain it [XX]

01:01:12.000 --> 01:01:13.000
It kind of drew you

01:01:13.000 --> 01:01:15.000
A light [XX] creature

01:01:15.000 --> 01:01:16.000
It kind of drew you.

01:01:16.000 --> 01:01:20.000
I believed … I believed in it when I was younger,

01:01:20.000 --> 01:01:22.000
you know and I was kind of scared of it.
It was kind of frightening.

01:01:23.000 --> 01:01:24.000
Will-o’-the-wisp

01:01:24.000 --> 01:01:25.000
I bet, eh.

01:01:27.000 --> 01:01:30.000
You can’t offer any explanations then?

01:01:33.000 --> 01:01:37.000
You don’t remember any other instances it was used? [caointeach/?].

01:01:37.000 --> 01:01:40.000
[XX] said it was often applied to a person

01:01:40.000 --> 01:01:42.000
that was away on his own [XX] 

01:01:42.000 --> 01:01:45.000
A loner, a loner, aye.

01:01:45.000 --> 01:01:47.000
Aye, he’s quite right, it is.

01:01:48.000 --> 01:01:50.000
But, I mean it definitely …

01:01:50.000 --> 01:01:52.000
it definitely … it means a human.

01:01:52.000 --> 01:01:54.000
It doesn’t mean anything in the line of a …

01:01:54.000 --> 01:01:57.000
