01:02:07.000 --> 01:02:10.000
No, we just took it for granted, you know.

01:02:10.000 --> 01:02:12.000
We just took it it was only a word, you know.

01:02:12.000 --> 01:02:14.000
Is it a Gaelic?

01:02:14.000 --> 01:02:15.000
Aye, it comes from Gaelic

01:02:15.000 --> 01:02:17.000
And can you not get … can you get the meaning oot of it?

01:02:17.000 --> 01:02:21.000
Well, in the … that …

01:02:21.000 --> 01:02:23.000
Aye, you’re quite right there.

