Cacaidh?

01:02:30.000 --> 01:02:33.000
Shite …

01:02:38.000 --> 01:02:40.000
is that not a colour?

01:02:40.000 --> 01:02:41.000
Is that a colour you mean?

01:02:41.000 --> 01:02:44.000
No, that’s Gaelic again just for the very word you used.

