You got them on a lot of flowers.
That’s right.

01:04:30.000 --> 01:04:31.000
Dahlias.

01:04:31.000 --> 01:04:36.000
We had to stop with growing a rose tree because the place was covered in …

01:04:36.000 --> 01:04:38.000
Aye, even dahlias have hundreds and thousands in the summertime.

01:04:38.000 --> 01:04:40.000
I was awfu fond of these …
Black …

01:04:40.000 --> 01:04:42.000
you couldn’t take a bunch of dahlias in. [...]

01:04:42.000 --> 01:04:43.000
That was the word you used …

01:04:43.000 --> 01:04:45.000
That was the way we pronounced it - [collag-lìn?].

