That was the word you used generally? You wouldn’t use earwig?

01:04:47.000 --> 01:04:50.000
No, it wasn’t earwigs. It was only in later years it was earwigs.

01:04:50.000 --> 01:04:54.000
Put in on till we hear it before Molly goes away. Molly’s going away.

01:04:54.000 --> 01:04:58.000
[XX] what have you done to your ears? Mind they used to say.

